==Battleground==
*6 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 8.67 seconds<sup>260f</sup>, delay 10.67~13.33 seconds<sup>320f~400f</sup>.
*4 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Redhead Muscled Yuki Cat (Enemy)|Redhead Muscled Yuki Cat]] spawns as the boss after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>.
**6 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 6 seconds<sup>180f</sup>, delay 13.33~16 seconds<sup>400f~480f</sup>.
**4 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 10~12 seconds<sup>300f~360f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use Melee and Tanker units like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] to slowly whittle down the boss. Although most midrangers are outranged by Redhead Muscled Yuki, some of these cats have good enough damage and health to be worth using anyways.(e.g. [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]] or [[Figure Skating Cats (Super Rare Cat)|Drama Cats]])

